# The fixed question set the name questions are measured against on Kibana
# (variance-authority-examples, HEAD 2df7209048767f154e91695e9456cfcad6be35af).
# `tools/name-questions.mjs` reads it. One question per line:
#   name <case> <Name>      asked as `ask symbol` and as `ask uses`
#   search <words>          asked as `ask search --query`
#   entrypoint <package>    asked as `ask entrypoint --package`
#   packages | gaps         asked as they stand
# A case is what the name tests in the store, not a property of the answer.

